# A half cast as an effect resolves needs its targets like any cast (CR 608.2g, 601.2c): Improvisation Capstone exiles Lake-town
# Mariners (mana value 6, so the exile stops there), and with a Forest and an Ornithopter to aim at, Bot1 is asked which face to cast
# and casts Gone Fishing for free, exiling and returning both. The Mariners wait in exile on an adventure. The negative control is
# improvisation-capstone-casts-only-the-mariners-creature-when-gone-fishing-has-one-thing-to-aim-at.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Improvisation Capstone
Forest
Ornithopter
Island
Lake-town Mariners
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Improvisation Capstone.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lake-town Mariners)
Bot1.Modes(Gone Fishing)
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter; Forest)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.SummoningSick = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = false
Exile = Lake-town Mariners; Improvisation Capstone
